  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/09RD">Situation <span data-tag="09RD">36.29.1</span>.</a> Let $S = \mathop{\mathrm{lim}}\nolimits _{i \in I} S_ i$ be a limit of a directed system of schemes with affine transition morphisms $f_{i'i} : S_{i'} \to S_ i$. We assume that $S_ i$ is quasi-compact and quasi-separated for all $i \in I$. We denote $f_ i : S \to S_ i$ the projection. We also fix an element $0 \in I$. </p>
